#ASSERT `s 76D(5A) the company has obtained the consent the subsection requires before passing the special resolution` FALSE 4 3 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6)(a): a member or person who holds shares to which the resolution relates is regarded as exercising the voting rights when voting on a poll or otherwise.
#ASSERT `s 76D(6)(a) the member or person is regarded as exercising the voting rights carried by the shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
