-- The prohibition of s 76E(1): a market purchase with no authority in advance is a breach; an authorised one is fulfilled.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 76E(1) the company must not make a market purchase unless it is authorised in advance` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 76E(1) make a purchase or acquisition of its own shares on a securities exchange without authority given in advance by the company in general meeting` AT 5
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 76E(1) the company must not make a market purchase unless it is authorised in advance` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 76E(1) make a purchase or acquisition of its own shares on a securities exchange without authority given in advance by the company in general meeting` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 76E(1) the company must not make a market purchase unless it is authorised in advance` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)
